OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland founder says its time is
OL,4,Alimited                                
OL,6,FThe founder of Poundland Steve Smith   
OL,7,Fhas said the business will be "gone    
OL,8,Fforever" if a buyer is not found before
OL,9,Fnext week.                             
OL,11,FPoundland is continuing to trade on the
OL,12,Fhigh street as administrators seek to  
OL,13,Fsell it and its assets, but Smith - no 
OL,14,Flonger with the retailer - said stores 
OL,15,Fwere receiving no new stock.           
OL,17,FHe warned: "There's going to be nothing
OL,18,Fleft on the shelves and if [the        
OL,19,Fsituation continues] beyond this       
OL,20,Fweekend there'd be nothing for the     
OL,21,Fbuyers to buy."                        
