OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland founder says its time is
OL,4,Alimited                                
OL,6,FIn response, Gordon Brothers, the      
OL,7,FAmerican owner of Poundland, said it   
OL,8,Fwas trying to preserve as many jobs and
OL,9,Fstores as possible. Administrators     
OL,10,FAlixPartners declined to comment.      
